01:20:27.906 --> 01:20:29.741
Hace unos años, hubo intentos…

01:20:29.825 --> 01:20:30.659
Hola.

01:20:31.827 --> 01:20:33.328
- Regresé.
- Come pizza.

01:20:33.411 --> 01:20:34.538
No tengo hambre.

01:20:34.621 --> 01:20:37.457
